VERSION ""

NS_ :

BS_:

BU_: DUT TESTER

BO_ 256 DutStatus: 1 DUT
 SG_ counter : 0|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" TESTER

BO_ 257 EngineData: 2 DUT
 SG_ EngineSpeed : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "rpm" TESTER

BO_ 1792 DutReset: 1 TESTER
 SG_ Request : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DUT

BO_ 1793 TesterPresent: 1 TESTER
 SG_ Active : 0|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" DUT

CM_ BO_ 256 "The simulated DUT's alive message, every 10 ms while it runs. counter counts modulo 16 and restarts at 0 on every boot.";
CM_ BO_ 257 "Engine speed as the simulated DUT reports it, every 10 ms while it runs.";
CM_ BO_ 1792 "Sent by the tester. Request = 1 resets the DUT; any other value is not a reset.";
CM_ BO_ 1793 "Sent cyclically by the tester while the DUT is in an operating mode. The simulated DUT does not need it; it is there to be sent.";
